<p>Hello <%= @member_one.name %> and <%= @member_two.name %>,</p>

<p>You've been matched for a one-on-one conversation. Take full advantage of this opportunity to talk to another leader on a topic that interests you both! We're sure you'll both enjoy it.</p>

<% if @topic.present? %>
  <p>You both chose the topic: <strong><%= @topic.name %></strong>.</p>
<% end %>

<% if @slot_utc.present? %>
  <p>You both marked this 1-hour window as workable:</p>
  <p><strong><%= @slot_utc %></strong></p>
  <ul>
    <% @local_slots.each do |member, label| %>
      <% next if label.blank? %>
      <li><%= member.name %>: <%= label %></li>
    <% end %>
  </ul>
<% end %>

<p>This is the window you both picked. You're both on this email — hit <strong>Reply all</strong> to introduce yourselves and agree how you'll meet up. We're so glad you're connecting!</p>

<p>Have a restful weekend.</p>

<p>Love,<br>— WE Match</p>
